                        "entry_id": "006586f0-24a7-3d8d-8d4a-70ef1f6318c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bratina, a traditional Russian wooden or copper pitcher for dispensing beer or kvass at festivals or large dinners, wine bowl, loving cup"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2123ea0-8c69-4a96-b180-73409544bebb",
                                "sense_id": "31de6f52-0c9a-3121-a42f-6432587cf0fb",
                                "text": "Ковши́, ча́ши, блю́да и бра́тины широко́ предста́влены в колле́кции Оруже́йной пала́ты Моско́вского Кремля́.",
                                "translation": "Scoops, bowls, dishes, and loving cups (bratinas) are richly represented in the collection of the Kremlin Armoury.",
                                "english": "Scoops, bowls, dishes, and loving cups (bratinas) are richly represented in the collection of the Kremlin Armoury."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
